OL,3,GNEWSAPolice arrest 33 in child sexual  
OL,4,Aexploitation probe                     
OL,6,FPolice say 33 people have been arrested
OL,7,Fin connection with an investigation    
OL,8,Finto the sexual exploitation of teenage
OL,9,Fgirls in Southampton.                  
OL,11,FHampshire Police said it had seized    
OL,12,Fmore than 80 mobile phones as          
OL,13,Fdetectives gathered evidence and       
OL,14,Fidentified suspects.                   
OL,16,FThe force said it was working with     
OL,17,Fpartner organisations to support and   
OL,18,Fsafeguard the girls, while officers    
OL,19,Fmonitored strict bail conditions       
OL,20,Fimposed on suspects.                   
